<title>HONG KONG: China Overseas seeks US$60 mln loan.</title>
<headline>China Overseas seeks US$60 mln loan.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>China Overseas Land and Investment Ltd (COLI) plans to issue a US$60 million term loan facility, bankers said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Sanwa Bank Hong Kong is the arranger, they said.</p>
<p>No further details were available.</p>
<p>COLI completed a US$60 million three-year term loan last June. It paid a margin of 135 basis points over the London Interbank Offered Rate.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
